dialect protocol stdio.zip.mutation
; `ZipMutation::encode_op` is `serde_json::to_vec` of the exact same shape as the sibling text
; grammar (`../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio`) — the binary op is the UTF-8 byte encoding of
; that JSON object, no separate framing or magic.
payload = utf8-bytes-of(mutation-line)
